b_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/d4ed2faf49ef70200ae042558776da10.webp?t=1772539752\" width=1200 height=52 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/80d0d62df6f941af483b235132e46008.poster.avif?t=1772539752\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/80d0d62df6f941af483b235132e46008.webm?t=1772539752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/80d0d62df6f941af483b235132e46008.mp4?t=1772539752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the word gets out about your shop, customers will commission new toys and haggle for a better price. Make sure you understand their needs though! Your reputation will grow or decrease depending on your clientele\u2019s treatment - a happy patron will recommend you to their friends! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/c0d69e5e55332b318dabc7cebc575e56.webp?t=1772539752\" width=1200 height=52 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/f8b311c3f2a36e7ab36f7e1cddf550cd.poster.avif?t=1772539752\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/f8b311c3f2a36e7ab36f7e1cddf550cd.webm?t=1772539752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/f8b311c3f2a36e7ab36f7e1cddf550cd.mp4?t=1772539752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know your customers, and they\u2019ll reward you with hidden stories and mysteries. Visit emblematic locations in Salamanca - its markets, squares, university and even the countryside! - in a captivating journey inspired by a folk legend and mythology. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/d523be83dedb576c77966452aa6ebef6.webp?t=1772539752\" width=1200 height=52 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/ba538a108e9175cf01d9cc8e4a3c9c08.avif?t=1772539752\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the destiny of Salamanca by following two distinct mythic paths with their own perks and storyline. Your choice will influence the future of the town and the legacy of your toy shop, so pick wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/809c8580352a28fe78433df2c68241ae.avif?t=1772539752\" width=987 height=209 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relaxing casual gameplay with rewarding interactions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gorgeous art nouveau style </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Super cute plushies (*^_^*) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lovely piano music inspired in the 1910s and folk music from Castille</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/extras/c6e621ed6adbb5f0466c4c717e960f50.avif?t=1772539752\" width=616 height=340 /></span></p>","developers":["Uprising Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968270/b63546e8a37abade0c5204edf2830b111d2b67f5/header.jpg?t=1772539752","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2968270/1039022407/7702e0f768a29c0b2e9127d56157736cc7f44abe/1759135992/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759136699","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2968270/1039022407/7702e0f768a29c0b2e9127d56157736cc7f44abe/1759135992/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759136699","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2968270/1039022407/7702e0f768a29c0b2e9127d56157736cc7f44abe/1759135992/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759136699","id":257062953,"name":"Toymaker Official Annoucement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257062953/c76ba4c94b31598e6890fac8978e6e0f30794ffa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759136699"}],"name":"Toymaker: Threads of Joy","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core (Intel / AMD)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 660 | AMD HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Quad Core (Intel / AMD)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050 | AMD HD 7950<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linu